project-name/
│
├── notebooks/ 
│   └── main_notebook.ipynb        # original development notebook (cleaned & readable)
│
├── src/                          
│   ├── data_preprocessing.py      # data cleaning, feature engineering, preprocessing
│   ├── model.py                   # model architecture/training functions
│   ├── utils.py                   # helper functions (metrics, visualization, etc.)
│   └── inference.py               # for making predictions with trained model
│
├── data/                          # (Optional: no raw data, only sample/tiny version if dataset is huge)
│   └── sample.csv                 
│
├── results/                       
│   ├── figures/                   # plots, charts, confusion matrix, ROC curves, etc.
│   └── metrics.json               # final evaluation scores
│
├── requirements.txt               # exact Python dependencies
├── environment.yml                # conda environment (optional but professional)
├── .gitignore                     # ignore large datasets, logs, .ipynb_checkpoints
├── LICENSE                        # MIT or Apache-2.0 (client-friendly, shows professionalism)
├── README.md                      # project description (catchy, client-oriented)
└── CONTRIBUTING.md                # (Optional, makes repo look more professional)
